{
  "_about": "Picture filters and picture motions, shared by the video builder (lib/fx.py) and the live preview (lib/fx.js). A filter is a set of adjustments; both sides turn it into the same colour formula, so the preview shows what the video gets. Effects (shake, flash ..) are drawn over the whole frame for a stretch of time: fx.effect_chain in the builder, edEffects in ui/editor.js.",
